{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ねっいきなり知らない人から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『１１日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールがきたのぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリしてずっと何が\n『１１日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nなんだろう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思っててだれだろぅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って悩んでたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず\n『だれ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nって送ったら\n『若月"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nって返ってきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでまあや思い出したのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一時間くらい前に曜日のことでメールしてたのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、メールしてちょっと携帯イジイジしてたら...なんと.........\n《全件リセットされました。》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってでたのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから全部消えててリセットされてたのっ...ワカチュキのアドがだれかわからなかったのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんよぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上今日のショックな話"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうねっワカチュキは面白い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blogみたらわかるでしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうあのままよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワカチュキの口癖は\n『しくったぁ』\n『あっぶねぇ死ぬとこだった』\nワカチュキはすぐ死んじゃうのよぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまじ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんといいおねぇちゃま"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きんぴらゴボウご飯"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニンジン&ゴマ&こんにゃく&ゴボウがはいってるのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オイシィヨォ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校帰りともだちと食べ物屋さんで勉強してたら(ちぃちゃん)にあった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリしたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前はピンポンしてきたのはロッティちゃんだったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで二人でお部屋でくつろいだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってることは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度質問返ししていいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/4862197/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}